  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment provides operational services in supporting the delivery of the Australian Aid Program in Papua New Guinea (PNG). This includes staffing costs for the development staff in country and travel costs for monitoring and evaluation of the various Aid Programs.</narrative>
